        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyumba ja AMBUJE jili jakusalala, nambo patiyicitendekwa yeleyi, mundu jwalijose jwakupita taciŵa jwakusimonga nipo taciwusya kuti, ‘Ana ligongo cici AMBUJE atesile yindu yakusakalayi kwa ŵandu ŵawo ni soni pa nyumbaji?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
