            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵandu tacijanga kuti, ‘Ligongo lyakuti ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵakanile AMBUJE, Mlungu jwawo juŵakopwesye acinangolo ŵawo kutyocela mcilambo ca Iguputo. M'malo mwakwe ŵatandite kujilambila milungu jine. Ali ni ligongo lyakwe AMBUJE ŵapele ŵanduwo yisawusyo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.22"
            ]
